Z||000000||phillip||06-18-2000||03:04 PM||||<BR>i'm out driving before work (2nd shift) but stop by my house before i go. a guy in a lowered loud lincoln mark 5 has been with me for about the last mile or so. sound like he's done some engine work and i see a guage added to the interior (which means nothing but did make me curious). <P>any way he pulls up at my house when i stop to ask about my car. says he used to work on fieros for racing and he has a bunch of performance parts. ok this is were the boots might be needed (if not already).<P>he tells me he can put a v-8 in for $500 plus the cost of the engine (pontiac 301). with my dual exhaust he thinks i have a v6. he says he can get about 260 horses out of it. when i tell him it's a 4 cyl. he says he can still get about 180 horses. i can't help it. i ask for a card, he dosen't have one. he tells me where he lives (kinda forgotten already) and i take off for work.<P>i don't really believe him since nearly all he said dosen't match what i've heard and read but i've got to find him again. if any of it's true i need to get with him. will there be a swap meet at this focoa gathering. if he realy has something maybe he can set up. if he's got something really good i'm deleting this post and doing some hoardin'. i'll let y'all know if i find out anything good (maybe).||||reg||1
